{"text": "El flautista tocó de nuevo en la plaza. Las familias se acercaron para escuchar. Cuando terminó, contó lo sucedido. Nadie fue apartado ni puesto en peligro: todos pudieron conversar sobre la importancia de cumplir una promesa de trabajo. Una madre: Resolveremos esto hablando y con justicia.", "words": [{"start": 0.109083, "end": 0.330624, "from": 0, "to": 2}, {"start": 0.345375, "end": 1.024708, "from": 3, "to": 12}, {"start": 1.0395, "end": 1.393958, "from": 13, "to": 17}, {"start": 1.408708, "end": 1.526874, "from": 18, "to": 20}, {"start": 1.541625, "end": 1.896083, "from": 21, "to": 26}, {"start": 1.910833, "end": 1.984666, "from": 27, "to": 29}, {"start": 1.999416, "end": 2.102791, "from": 30, "to": 32}, {"start": 2.117583, "end": 2.619708, "from": 33, "to": 38}, {"start": 3.647791, "end": 3.898874, "from": 40, "to": 43}, {"start": 3.913625, "end": 4.445291, "from": 44, "to": 52}, {"start": 4.460083, "end": 4.548708, "from": 53, "to": 55}, {"start": 4.563458, "end": 5.213249, "from": 56, "to": 65}, {"start": 5.228041, "end": 5.420041, "from": 66, "to": 70}, {"start": 5.434791, "end": 6.158457, "from": 71, "to": 79}, {"start": 7.177458, "end": 7.517124, "from": 81, "to": 87}, {"start": 7.531916, "end": 8.137416, "from": 88, "to": 95}, {"start": 8.418, "end": 8.846291, "from": 97, "to": 102}, {"start": 8.861041, "end": 8.979207, "from": 103, "to": 105}, {"start": 8.993958, "end": 9.747166, "from": 106, "to": 114}, {"start": 10.766166, "end": 11.209207, "from": 116, "to": 121}, {"start": 11.224, "end": 11.401208, "from": 122, "to": 125}, {"start": 11.416, "end": 11.991958, "from": 126, "to": 134}, {"start": 12.00675, "end": 12.139666, "from": 135, "to": 137}, {"start": 12.154416, "end": 12.523624, "from": 138, "to": 144}, {"start": 12.538416, "end": 12.627041, "from": 145, "to": 147}, {"start": 12.641791, "end": 13.188207, "from": 148, "to": 155}, {"start": 13.557416, "end": 13.926624, "from": 157, "to": 162}, {"start": 13.941416, "end": 14.399249, "from